    "title": "Truline gives away a roof to a lucky winner! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Andrea Rollins No media credit provided. ,\n11 hours ago\nBECKLEY, WV (WVNS) — Nothing beats a sturdy roof over your head and Truline, a contracting company in Beckley, gave away a roof on April 14, 2026.\nWyoming County students place in Top 3 for Samsung Solve for Tomorrow competition The giveaway was advertised in various places including a home show. Tuesday, April 14, 2026 was the big day when they picked the winner though! They drew name out of all the entries. The winner was set to get a $10,000 roof!\nExcitedly, those with Truline lined up and drew a name.\nConnie Wood was the lucky winner chosen. Those with Truline say they are excited to give back to the community who gave so much to them.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WVNS.\n3",
